Subject: [PATCH 6/6] =?UTF-8?q?pipeline:=20simple:=20Add=20=E2=80=9Cmtk-md?=
 =?UTF-8?q?p3=E2=80=9D=20converter=20to=20mtk-seninf=20camera=20device?=
